9. WGSI must comply with all applicable orders, directions and conditions, and obtain and comply with 
all applicable tenures, licences, regulations, approvals, standards and permits, or other authorities, which 
may include or result from, but are not necessarily limited to, the following enactments:
a) Agricultural Land Commission Act, R.S.B.C. 1979, c. 9 and General Order 293/95;
b) Commercial Transport Act, R.S.B.C. 1979, c. 55;
c) Fisheries Act, R.S.B.C. 1979, c. 137;
d) Forest Act, R.S.B.C. 1979, c. 140;
e) Forest Practices Code of British Columbia Act, S.B.C. 1994, c. 41;
(f) Gas Safety Act, R.S.B.C. 1979, c. 149;
g) Health Act, R.S.B.C. 1979, c. 161;
h) Heritage Conservation Act, R.S.B.C. 1979 c. 165;
i) Highway Act, R.S.B.C. 1979, c. 167;
j) Land Act, R.S;B.C. 1979, c; 214;
